			"notes": "- Added Enchantment Helper item hover tooltips and a settings toggle.\n- Added Enchantment Helper item ranking for illegal, perfect, max, good, and enchanted items.\n- Refined perfect/max ranking around valid enchantment variants and max-level guide builds.\n- Added Enchantment Helper text display modes for full text, rank-only, or icon-only rows.\n- Disabled rank labels/styling for enchanted books.\n- Adjusted MAX and CURSED colors, with cursed rows using plain white styling and no background.\n- Allowed the Enchantment Helper panel width to shrink to icon + Take button layout.\n- Colored max-level enchanted books with the MAX color while keeping books unranked.\n- Added Mob Health heart wrapping with configurable hearts per row for high-health mobs.\n- Bumped addon version to 0.2.04.\n\nMinecraft: 26.1.2\nLoader: Fabric\nClient: Meteor"
